cause: UNKNOWN_CAUSE
header_text {
  translation {
    text: "A Line Proposed Service Change:"
    language: "en"
  }
}
description_text {
  translation {
    text: "Schedule adjustments, modifying early morning and evening service frequencies as follows: 3 a.m. to 6 a.m.: 30-minute frequency 6:00 a.m. to 7:30 p.m.: 15-minute frequency 7:30 p.m. to end of service: 30-minute frequency (as compared to current schedule, which transitions to 30-minute frequency beginning with the 6:30 p.m. and 7 p.m. departures) The proposed change to schedule timing would result in the loss of (2) daily morning trips.\r\n\nReason\r\n\nAdjusting the span of 15-minute service better aligns frequency with customer demand by providing more frequent service later into the evening. Schedule changes also create more consistent departure times during periods of 30-minute service, making the schedule easier to understand while improving operational efficiency and better aligning service with contractual requirements."
    language: "en"
  }
}
